            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.2.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 2:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.5.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "5:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JAS.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yak 1:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima abo batsigazi bana Ruhanga yaabaha okumanya n'okuba abahangu omuri byona ebi barikwega n'omu bwengye; kandi Danieli we yaagira okwetegyereza omu by'okworekwa byona n'omu by'okushoboorora ebirooto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obunaku, obu omugabe Nebukadeneeza yaaragiire kubareeteramu, ku bwahikire, omukuru w'abakonwa yaabareeta kubamumurikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku baahikire aho, omugabe yaagaaniira nabo; kwonka omu bandi boona tiharabonekiremu owaabaire ari nka Danieli, Hanania, Mishaeli na Azaria; nikyo baabeereire ab'okuheereza omugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.2.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 2:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.41.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 41:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi omu bigambo byona eby'obwengye n'eby'okwetegyereza, akashanga nibakira abafumu n'abarogi boona, abaabaire bari omu bugabe bwe bwona emirundi ikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
